{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rise of the Penguins&quot; is a 2D Side-Scrolling\u00a0 Action-Platformer for Gameboy. The game is meant to be simple and linear but with some challenging enemies. The game is inspired by ghost n goblins and a bit of mega man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 levels</strong> with a variety of enemies in each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Extra Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush Mode</strong>, Unlocked only after beating all 6 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 mini boss</strong> enemies and <strong>8 boss</strong> enemies(including the 2 ks ones) and a <strong>final boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 simple difficulty settings</strong> to adjust checkpoints to make the game harder or easier, with checkpoints resetting after a game over but modifiable through these settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic hud</strong> that shows the highscore, health and time remaining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Janky animations</strong> made by me</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal story</strong> with no text -but hoping the game is engaging enough to keep playing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404520?t=1745954911","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404520?t=1745954911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404520/c0a8a86e757d100427aaef1765077c119a9fdd46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745954911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404520/c0a8a86e757d100427aaef1765077c119a9fdd46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745954911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rise of the Penguins&quot; is a 2D Side-Scrolling\u00a0 Action-Platformer for Gameboy. The game is meant to be simple and linear but with some challenging enemies. The game is inspired by ghost n goblins and a bit of mega man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 levels</strong> with a variety of enemies in each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Extra Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush Mode</strong>, Unlocked only after beating all 6 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 mini boss</strong> enemies and <strong>8 boss</strong> enemies(including the 2 ks ones) and a <strong>final boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 simple difficulty settings</strong> to adjust checkpoints to make the game harder or easier, with checkpoints resetting after a game over but modifiable through these settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic hud</strong> that shows the highscore, health and time remaining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Janky animations</strong> made by me</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal story</strong> with no text -but hoping the game is engaging enough to keep playing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bill Woo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404520/header.jpg?t=1745954911","is_free":true,"linux_requirem